	(footprint "class_board:OLED-0.96in-4P-module-socket"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "8c611ab5-a0af-504a-8e87-e4de00717c1a")
		(at 162.45 11.2 0)
		(descr "0.96 in 128x64 I2C OLED module (4-pin GND VCC SCL SDA, 27.3 x 27.8 mm PCB) plugged into a vertical 1x4 2.54 mm female header 8.5 mm tall (XFCN PZ254-1-04-Z-8.5, LCSC C2894927); the module lies flat 11 mm above the board and is held by four M2 screws through its corner holes (23.5 x 23.8 mm, verify on the real module) into M2 stand-offs. Anchor = centre of the pad row (the socket, the part JLC places). Courtyard = socket + the four holes only: the module body hangs 11 mm above the board and may overhang other parts.")
